-- l4 lint fixture: the same prose as lint-notwithstanding-unwired.l4, written in
-- the two-layer defeat idiom: section 7 yields by calling the prevailing
-- section 9, negated. No finding.
@ref Act s 9 — "Notwithstanding section 7, the Director may grant extensions."
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 9 — extensions may be granted` n MEANS
    n GREATER THAN 1

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7 — extensions are barred` n MEANS
        n GREATER THAN 10
    AND NOT (`s 9 — extensions may be granted` n)
